{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_6fc90d7a244242228d0b761596920e7f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0247b9ab9dd034769fb40325b7d32697a68894b7933fc13b4a0359299a2f1f9d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"raizamartin/gemini-code@6da9a30cb311 snapshot 9eb3066a1eb58a2e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c0d4d257b06a059de88b4dc17106369df021aa30e639790e4d3d20e92637d02e","slc_c7416b4de384d63ed73b40b4f7d28a04538f48f2c11569a24b7ae61eef968987","slc_f871344f77ac629283b6557d00d976046c00346d2289f0602e8c97709d865d23"],"source_ids":["src_8f574270adde57c099a742575aa8bad2"],"text":"The assistant automatically invokes tools itself rather than exposing them as user commands: file operations (view, edit, list, grep, glob), directory operations (ls, tree, create_directory), and bash system commands.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6fc90d7a244242228d0b761596920e7f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_6fc90d7a244242228d0b761596920e7f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1b88c573f706913b85a7634b11e8d4cc5bb2ad8ca57c717cab113a4684ea7d2e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"raizamartin/gemini-code@6da9a30cb311 snapshot 9eb3066a1eb58a2e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2c16bcd83a9fa51c9a42233f1c120813989c4c77d42b6ee83b0f733b2e5b174b","slc_3454572048b613c3cb1a7d8f4fcaa7e50b4abb62d5184f7ff9db47234f0e5308","slc_c98d25812dabcdd34357f1661d830661b335e1544f2a0f0231adcde423a60531"],"source_ids":["src_8f574270adde57c099a742575aa8bad2"],"text":"Users can start a session with a specific model via `gemini --model <model>`, set a default model with `set-default-model`, and list available models with `list-models`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6fc90d7a244242228d0b761596920e7f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_6fc90d7a244242228d0b761596920e7f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2b987f4b25d74c599760dd3c0cc90db23102816fddc1476308af1c61f84d9694","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"raizamartin/gemini-code@6da9a30cb311 snapshot 9eb3066a1eb58a2e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_dc6fc2f10ff6770ae86ed926a1358a81cd36f11b4d41b07f34c10567a3bffe6a"],"source_ids":["src_8f574270adde57c099a742575aa8bad2"],"text":"The system prompt was tuned to make the assistant a proactive coding partner that prioritizes creating and modifying files over printing code, with a thinking/planning phase whose output is filtered from final responses.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6fc90d7a244242228d0b761596920e7f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_6fc90d7a244242228d0b761596920e7f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3aae5a308510d3a434dfaff69ece4212dd7f183b1847f9d163c3f4f66adb4b68","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"raizamartin/gemini-code@6da9a30cb311 snapshot 9eb3066a1eb58a2e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3a8d8cf70a51d5a8e6f46b5d63c23550adc4e4bb4efe13e1bfa262dd8e7d3ebd","slc_55296c705981064a85b38da7b5f81c8913497d2e6617abc5a0605e265b2636b3"],"source_ids":["src_8f574270adde57c099a742575aa8bad2"],"text":"The design intentionally mimics Claude Code: tools are used behind the scenes by the assistant to make interaction natural, and a changelog entry describes moving to Gemini's native function calling for more reliable tool usage.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6fc90d7a244242228d0b761596920e7f"}
